WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: Static
NOTE Artist: The Stardust Engine

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:38.636
[Instrumental Intro — Driving Palm-Muted Warehouse Guitar Riff & Drums]

00:00:38.636 --> 00:00:42.500
You wanted pop, you wanted clean

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:46.593
A hollow sound from a thin machine

00:00:46.673 --> 00:00:53.878
You tried to tune me out, you tried to change the dial

00:00:53.918 --> 00:01:03.887
But I've been waiting all this while

00:01:05.999 --> 00:01:11.724
I am the static! I am the noise!

00:01:11.844 --> 00:01:19.951
The signal breaking, the hidden voice!

00:01:19.971 --> 00:01:23.200
I am the static!

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:26.537
The feedback wail!

00:01:26.617 --> 00:01:33.500
The story that you tried to derail!

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:39.444
[Guitar & Vocal Interlude]

00:01:39.444 --> 00:01:46.466
This isn't synth-pop, this isn't grace

00:01:46.566 --> 00:01:53.808
This is the sound of a different place

00:01:53.828 --> 00:01:58.400
This is the heart you tried to hide

00:01:58.470 --> 00:02:05.500
The part of us that never died!

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:11.500
I am the static! I am the noise!

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:18.500
The signal breaking, the hidden voice!

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:23.066
I am the static! The feedback wail!

00:02:23.086 --> 00:02:30.000
The story that you tried to derail!

00:02:30.000 --> 00:03:06.335
[Guitar Solo — Raw Overdriven Warehouse Shred Solo]

00:03:06.335 --> 00:03:13.119
I am the static! I am the noise!

00:03:13.199 --> 00:03:21.444
The signal breaking, the hidden voice!

00:03:21.504 --> 00:03:27.947
I am the static! The feedback wail!

00:03:27.987 --> 00:03:34.000
The story that you tried to derail!

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:38.164
I am the static... I am the static...

00:03:38.224 --> 00:03:43.000
Can you hear me now?

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:56.000
[Outro — Repeating Staccato Warehouse Guitar Riff]
